<title>USA: Cedar Hill, Texas, school deal at 4.95 pct in 2004.</title>
<headline>Cedar Hill, Texas, school deal at 4.95 pct in 2004.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
